OL,3,GNEWSAQEH student removal linked to
OL,4,A'leadership vacuum'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior medical school leaders believed
OL,7,Fit was "not safe nor appropriate" to
OL,8,Fsend students to the Queen Elizabeth
OL,9,FHospital in King's Lynn (QEH) and
OL,10,Fwarned of an "ongoing and expanding
OL,11,Fvacuum of leadership", newly released
OL,12,Fdocuments show.
OL,14,FEmails obtained under the Freedom of
OL,15,FInformation Act (FOI) also reveal that
OL,16,FNHS England identified concerns about
OL,17,Fracism and misogyny within surgical
OL,18,Ftraining.
